{"ref":"BDB, יָֽשָׁבְעָם","hw":"יָֽשָׁבְעָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יָֽשָׁבְעָם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> a hero of David;—<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.11\">1 Ch 11:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.7\">12:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.2\">27:2</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ישֵׁב בַּשֶּׁבֶת</span>, q.v. p. 444 supra, in <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.8\">2 S 23:8</a>, v. Dr); Ιεσεβαδα, Ιεσσεβααλ, Ισβααμ, etc.; read in all <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשְׁבַּעַל</span> We al.","next":"BDB, י֥וּשַׁב חֶ֖סֶר","prev":"BDB, יָשֻׁ֫בִי לָ֑חֶם"}